7882: are:
7883: 
7884: <ol>
7885:  <li><p>If <a>this</a>'s <a for=Element>attribute list</a> does not <a for=list>contain</a>
7886:  <var>attr</var>, then <a>throw</a> a "{{NotFoundError!!exception}}" {{DOMException}}.
