7892: </div>
7893: 
7894: <hr>
7895: 
7896: <dl class=domintro>
7897:  <dt><code><var>shadow</var> = <var>element</var> . {{attachShadow(init)}}</code>
7898:  <dd><p>Creates a <a for=/>shadow root</a> for <var>element</var> and returns it.
7899: 
7900:  <dt><code><var>shadow</var> = <var>element</var> . {{shadowRoot}}</code>
7901:  <dd><p>Returns <var>element</var>'s <a for=Element>shadow root</a>, if any, and if
7902:  <a for=/>shadow root</a>'s <a for=ShadowRoot>mode</a> is "<code>open</code>"; otherwise null.
7903: </dl>
7904: 
7905: <p>A <dfn export>valid shadow host name</dfn> is:
7906: 
7907: <ul class=brief>
7908:  <li>a <a>valid custom element name</a>
7909:  <li>"<code>article</code>",
7910:  "<code>aside</code>",
7911:  "<code>blockquote</code>",
7912:  "<code>body</code>",
7913:  "<code>div</code>",
7914:  "<code>footer</code>",
7915:  "<code>h1</code>",
7916:  "<code>h2</code>",
7917:  "<code>h3</code>",
7918:  "<code>h4</code>",
7919:  "<code>h5</code>",
7920:  "<code>h6</code>",
7921:  "<code>header</code>",
7922:  "<code>main</code>",
7923:  "<code>nav</code>",
7924:  "<code>p</code>",
7925:  "<code>section</code>", or
7926:  "<code>span</code>"
7927: </ul>
7928: 
7929: <p class=note>This list is intentionally limited so that built-in elements can gain internal
7930: <a>shadow trees</a> over time as needed.
7931: 
7932: <div algorithm>
7933: <p>The <dfn method for=Element><code>attachShadow(<var>init</var>)</code></dfn> method steps are:
7934: 
7935: <ol>
7936:  <li><p>Let <var>registry</var> be <a>this</a>'s <a>node document</a>'s
7937:  <a for=Document>custom element registry</a>.
7938: 
7939:  <li><p>If <var>init</var>["{{ShadowRootInit/customElementRegistry}}"] <a for=map>exists</a>, then
7940:  set <var>registry</var> to it.
7941: 
7942:  <li><p>If <var>registry</var> is non-null, <var>registry</var>'s
7943:  <a for=CustomElementRegistry>is scoped</a> is false, and <var>registry</var> is not <a>this</a>'s
7944:  <a>node document</a>'s <a for=Document>custom element registry</a>, then <a>throw</a> a
7945:  "{{NotSupportedError!!exception}}" {{DOMException}}.
7946: 
7947:  <li><p>Run <a>attach a shadow root</a> with <a>this</a>,
7948:  <var>init</var>["{{ShadowRootInit/mode}}"],
7949:  <var>init</var>["{{ShadowRootInit/delegatesFocus}}"],
7950:  <var>init</var>["{{ShadowRootInit/serializable}}"],
7951:  <var>init</var>["{{ShadowRootInit/slotAssignment}}"],
7952:  <var>init</var>["{{ShadowRootInit/clonable}}"], and <var>registry</var>.
7953: 
7954:  <li><p>Return <a>this</a>'s <a for=Element>shadow root</a>.
7955: </ol>
7956: </div>
7957: 
7958: <div algorithm>
7959: <p>To <dfn id=concept-attach-a-shadow-root>attach a shadow root</dfn>, given an <a for=/>element</a>
7960: <var>element</var>, a string <var>mode</var>, a boolean <var>delegatesFocus</var>, a boolean
7961: <var>serializable</var>, a string <var>slotAssignment</var>, a boolean <var>clonable</var>, and null
7962: or a {{CustomElementRegistry}} object <var>registry</var>:
7963: 
7964: <ol>
7965:  <li><p>If <var>element</var>'s <a for=Element>namespace</a> is not the <a>HTML namespace</a>,
7966:  then <a>throw</a> a "{{NotSupportedError!!exception}}" {{DOMException}}.
7967: 
7968:  <li><p>If <var>element</var>'s <a for=Element>local name</a> is not a
7969:  <a>valid shadow host name</a>, then <a>throw</a> a "{{NotSupportedError!!exception}}"
7970:  {{DOMException}}.
7971: 
7972:  <li>
7973:   <p>If <var>element</var>'s <a for=Element>local name</a> is a <a>valid custom element name</a>, or
7974:   <var>element</var>'s <a for=Element><code>is</code> value</a> is non-null:
7975: 
7976:   <ol>
7977:    <li><p>Let <var>definition</var> be the result of <a>looking up a custom element definition</a>
7978:    given <var>element</var>'s <a for=Element>custom element registry</a>, its
7979:    <a for=Element>namespace</a>, its <a for=Element>local name</a>, and its
7980:    <a for=Element><code>is</code> value</a>.
7981: 
7982:    <li><p>If <var>definition</var> is non-null and <var>definition</var>'s
7983:    <a for="custom element definition">disable shadow</a> is true, then <a>throw</a> a
7984:    "{{NotSupportedError!!exception}}" {{DOMException}}.
7985:   </ol>
7986:  </li>
7987: 
7988:  <li>
7989:   <p>If <var>element</var> is a <a for=Element>shadow host</a>:
7990: 
7991:   <ol>
7992:    <li><p>Let <var>currentShadowRoot</var> be <var>element</var>'s <a for=Element>shadow root</a>.
7993: 
7994:    <li>
7995:     <p>If any of the following are true:
7996: 
7997:     <ul>
7998:      <li><p><var>currentShadowRoot</var>'s <a for=ShadowRoot>declarative</a> is false; or
7999: 
8000:      <li><p><var>currentShadowRoot</var>'s <a for=ShadowRoot>mode</a> is not <var>mode</var>,
8001:     </ul>
8002: 
8003:     <p>then <a>throw</a> a "{{NotSupportedError!!exception}}" {{DOMException}}.
8004: 
8005:    <li><p><a for=/>Remove</a> all of <var>currentShadowRoot</var>'s <a for=tree>children</a>, in
8006:    <a>tree order</a>.
8007: 
8008:    <li><p>Set <var>currentShadowRoot</var>'s <a for=ShadowRoot>declarative</a> to false.
8009: 
8010:    <li><p>Return.
8011:   </ol>
8012: 
8013:  <li><p>Let <var>shadow</var> be the result of <a>creating a node</a> that implements
8014:  {{ShadowRoot}}, given <var>element</var>'s <a for=Node>node document</a>.
8015: 
8016:  <li><p>Set <var>shadow</var>'s <a for=DocumentFragment>host</a> to <var>element</var>.
8017: 
8018:  <li><p>Set <var>shadow</var>'s <a for=ShadowRoot>mode</a> to <var>mode</var>.
8019: 
8020:  <li><p>Set <var>shadow</var>'s <a for=ShadowRoot>delegates focus</a> to <var>delegatesFocus</var>.
8021: 
8022:  <li><p>If <var>element</var>'s <a for=Element>custom element state</a> is
8023:  "<code>precustomized</code>" or "<code>custom</code>", then set <var>shadow</var>'s
8024:  <a for=ShadowRoot>available to element internals</a> to true.
8025: 
8026:  <li><p>Set <var>shadow</var>'s <a for=ShadowRoot>declarative</a> to false.
8027: 
8028:  <li><p>Set <var>shadow</var>'s <a for=ShadowRoot>serializable</a> to <var>serializable</var>.
8029: 
8030:  <li><p>Set <var>shadow</var>'s <a for=ShadowRoot>slot assignment</a> to <var>slotAssignment</var>.
8031: 
8032:  <li><p>Set <var>shadow</var>'s <a for=ShadowRoot>clonable</a> to <var>clonable</var>.
8033: 
8034:  <li><p>Set <var>shadow</var>'s <a for=ShadowRoot>custom element registry</a> to
8035:  <var>registry</var>.
8036: 
8037:  <li><p>Set <var>element</var>'s <a for=Element>shadow root</a> to <var>shadow</var>.
8038: </ol>
8039: </div>
